 "notes": "Achievements modal: hanging blue banner at the top left overlapping the frame, laurel-and-star emblem plus gold-gradient 'Achievements' title (tall A + small caps) on a blue header band with a castle skyline at the right, wine-red square close button at top right. Six filter tabs in one shared strip (unselected tabs share the outer top/bottom rails and are split by thin brass posts at x 496/675/837/1016; each has an inner steel-blue frame); 'All' is SELECTED (glowing gold frame, warm brown fill, cream label, small gold stud on its bottom edge). Six achievement cards in a 3x2 grid; row 2 cards are taller (201 vs 190) to fit the 3-line Untouchable description. Each card: frameless diorama illustration on the left sitting directly on the dark card fill (art rects are the illustration bounds), small icon + crimson title, grey description lines, a rounded progress track with an inset fill, a centred 'n / m' count, then the reward button. States: First Blood is COMPLETE and CLAIMABLE (card frame glows gold/orange like the selected tab; gold CLAIM button with dark brown label and a coin-pile icon); District Marshal is IN PROGRESS at 0 / 1 (empty track, no button); Boss Slayer, Untouchable and Arcane Scholar are CLAIMED (full gold fill, dark slate CLAIMED button with check mark and a laurel sprig on each side, muted gold label); Survivor is IN PROGRESS at 18 / 30 with a BLUE fill (in-progress fills are blue, complete fills gold) and no button. Banners hang outside the modal on both sides above lit lanterns; crates/barrels fill the bottom corners. Steel-blue BACK TO MAP button (left chevron, cream uniform-caps label) centred on the bottom ledge."
